# HP2_PAD_SCRIPT for phase3_flicker.sh (XInput HLE syntax: src/hle/xinput/pad_script.h).
# New Game as in phase3_new_game.pad; in the Burrow yard a short tap turns
# Harry in place, then the camera eases round behind him for ~2 s with the
# yard's paving (grass patches) and the house in view: the moment the user
# saw decals flicker.
450 press A
520 press DOWN 4
540 press DOWN 4
560 press DOWN 4
600 press A
700 press A
6000 stick L 0.6 -0.2 10
